# Generated by `pnpm demo:browser`. Not committed: they are regenerable and can
# capture whatever your agent CLI happens to be showing, including account details.
screenshots/

# Design references pasted in while working. Same reason as above — they are
# screenshots of a real session, so keep `git add -A` from publishing them.
codex*.png

# CI artifacts (PA-65). `test-reports/` is the JUnit XML Bamboo's parser task
# globs; `release-digests.txt` is the per-release digest list `./build.sh -p`
# writes and Bamboo publishes as an artifact. Both are regenerated per build
# and describe one machine's run, so committing either would only ever be
# stale.
test-reports/
release-digests.txt
